------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream origin
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ForgeKeep began as a fork of IronForge:

    https://github.com/lengyuqu/ironforge

At the time of forking, the upstream IronForge repository did not ship a
LICENSE, NOTICE, or COPYING file, and GitHub reported no detected license for
it. The "MIT" wording that appeared in the upstream README was a badge only,
unaccompanied by any license text or copyright notice.

This NOTICE is provided in good faith to credit the upstream project and to
record the fork's provenance accurately. It does not assert that the upstream
code is MIT-licensed — that claim could not be verified. Anyone reusing code
that originates from upstream IronForge (rather than ForgeKeep's own changes)
should confirm the applicable terms with the upstream author directly.
